```java
class StackOverflowCause {
    static int sumTo(int n) {
        if (n < 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("n must be non-negative");
        if (n == 0) return 0;
        return n + sumTo(n - 1);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(sumTo(10));
    }
}
```

Changing `n - 1` to `n + 1` removes progress and demonstrates the bug conceptually; do not run the broken form in a shared service.

```java
class InstanceVariables {
    static final class Product {
        final String name;
        Product(String name) { this.name = name; }
    }

    static final class OrderLine {
        int quantity;
        Product product;
        OrderLine(int quantity, Product product) {
            this.quantity = quantity;
            this.product = product;
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Product shared = new Product("Book");
        OrderLine first = new OrderLine(2, shared);
        OrderLine second = new OrderLine(1, shared);
        System.out.println(first.quantity + second.quantity);
        System.out.println(first.product == second.product);
    }
}
```

